// Selective VPI signal visibility for TOPLEVEL=frost cocotb system builds.
// Top-level ports and the internal signals driven or read by the system
// benches are listed below so the unlisted hierarchy remains private to the
// compiled model. Set FROST_FULL_VISIBILITY=1, FROST_COVERAGE=1, or
// FROST_HANG_PROBE to build with full VPI visibility.
